<title>ITALY: Italian jobless rate rises to 12.2 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Italian jobless rate rises to 12.2 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following unemployment data in its quarterly report.</p>
<p>    ITALIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	Oct 96	July 96	Oct 95</p>
<p>     Pct unemployed		12.2	   11.7	 12.1</p>
<p>     Number of unemployed (million) 2.79	  2.69	 2.77</p>
</text>
